 (text "USB-C: TPS25751D PD sink + BQ25798 charger" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 3 3) (thickness 0.5) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "2849641e-7a19-5235-beec-d67fafdbd641"))
(text "TPS25751D in SafeMode (ADCIN1 = LDO_3V3, ADCIN2 = GND): loads its patch and configuration from the M24512 at 0x50" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 33.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "fc93d789-91ef-5b90-8ebe-e20f5926a2c9"))
(text "on I2Cc, negotiates up to 20 V and programs the BQ25798 (0x6B) on the same bus. Target port on the Jetson I2C." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "44a014f3-bd00-5886-a2b3-c7ec62bd2817"))
(text "BQ25798: PROG 17.4k = 4S, 1.5 MHz, 1 uH. TS fixed at 25 C (5.23k / 30.1k || 10k). ILIM_HIZ 39k / 100k = 3.25 A." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 43.18000000000001 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "6672805d-c6bc-53b1-a891-8eb0a46ba9f1"))
(text "SYS output is VSYS (NVDC path): the brain board and the lidar run from it, from USB power when it is plugged in." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 48.260000000000005 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "dbd84e78-fb9c-58d4-8276-0f3b351fc2c6"))
(text "EEPROM image: TI Application Customization Tool (TPS25751). Header J51 can program it off-line." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 53.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "392406eb-f266-5003-8d9d-56cfbfba660d"))
